  "title": "Process 1: posing a question",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "366f14f3-0c91-4811-b3fd-7dd5468483f7",
      "text": "Von Neumann's Process 1 poses a yes-or-no question to nature: at certain times the state jumps to $S(t) = P S(t-0) P + (1-P) S(t-0) (1-P)$, where $P$ is a projection operator whose two eigenvalues stand for the answers yes and no.",
